From 332ab954c1d80f1d9731ad8e948638a1251c7678 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: tomaszstaniak <68373859+tomaszstaniak@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 00:49:11 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] virgl.hidd: time spent per kind of work, printed as
 [virgl-stats] on the debug output when a context ends

The same report as the mainline driver: commands to the device (waiting
included), submits, uploads, downloads, resource creation and the parts of
presenting a frame (readback, WritePixelArray), with counts, total and
average time and bytes. Uses the E-clock of the timer the transport opens.
---
 workbench/hidds/virgl/mmakefile.src        |  1 +
 workbench/hidds/virgl/virgl_galliumclass.c |  6 ++
 workbench/hidds/virgl/virgl_stats.c        | 67 ++++++++++++++++++++++
 workbench/hidds/virgl/virgl_stats.h        | 21 +++++++
 workbench/hidds/virgl/virgl_transport.c    | 12 +++-
 workbench/hidds/virgl/virgl_winsys_aros.c  |  8 +++
 6 files changed, 114 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)
 create mode 100644 workbench/hidds/virgl/virgl_stats.c
 create mode 100644 workbench/hidds/virgl/virgl_stats.h

